abstract: "An iOS app that runs DistilGPT2 from scratch in Swift on Accelerate and visualises every step of next-word prediction: tokens, embeddings, attention heads, MLP neurons, the logit lens across layers, output probabilities, and every weight matrix, framed as how keyboard suggestions work."
keywords: [language models, interpretability, visualisation, education, iOS, on-device inference]
